      "id": "2067147966734008727",
      "text": "A trader reportedly used Claude Fable 5 to turn an $11,000 loss into $300,000 in just five days through an AI-powered trading algorithm on Polymarket.\n\nAccording to the claim, Fable 5 was not simply predicting prices. It was analyzing the full probability surface of the market, weighing every possible outcome, and identifying opportunities faster than the market could correct itself. One of those bets reportedly delivered a massive 205x return.\n\nSoon after, the model was pulled following government action, raising fresh questions around AI, prediction markets, trading automation, and the future of powerful AI models in financial systems.\n\nThe biggest twist? The Claude Fable 5 model may no longer be available, but the algorithm it created is reportedly still running on Polymarket.\n\nAI trading is no longer just about charts and signals. It is becoming a battle of speed, probability, data, and regulation.\n\nFollow us for more  AI, Crypto & Web3 insights! \n\nCopyright Disclaimer: All video rights belong to their respective owners. This content is shared under fair use for educational and informational purposes. \n\n#ClaudeFable5 #Anthropic #Polymarket #AITrading #TradingAlgorithm #PredictionMarkets #CryptoTrading",
