    {
      "id": "2067146534131757128",
      "text": "There's a leak from OpenAI—not your average leak, this one's flipping all expectations upside down!  \n    Imagine this: The new model we were expecting to drop under the name GPT-5.6 suddenly, with zero warning, gets a full name change! \n    It's: GPT-Bidi-1  The bottom line: They're saying its performance will match the powerhouse level of Claude Fable 5, but get this—you know how much? Three times cheaper! Meaning you pay just 30% of the cost of Claude Fable 5 and get the same performance, assuming the leaks are legit, of course.     \n   And the best part? The leaks say it's dropping super soon. So yeah, we're on the verge of witnessing the start of a whole new era in the world of artificial intelligence.  \n  Do you think GPT-Bidi-1 will shake up the game and force the competitors to rethink their strategies? Share your thoughts!",
      "author": {
        "id": "252521587",
        "name": "sheri vandenburg",
        "screenName": "sherivandenburg",
        "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/561663370659500033/V1sqcVTP_normal.jpeg",
        "verified": true
      },
      "metrics": {
        "likes": 0,
        "retweets": 0,
        "replies": 0,
        "quotes": 0,
        "views": 61,
