      "id": "2067146238391365729",
      "text": "As for betting on new games...\n\nI am not for a while. \n\nI know we need new games in the space. \n\nBut what we need is quality. \n\nIf we turn into threejs, fable 5 shovelware games then we are going to be worse off for it and everyone who bemoans web3 will be right. \n\nI think it is our job to gatekeep now.",
